entric, not willing to further education). So we can say we have observations: C keeps calm in crisis (stress resilience) and understands complicated technology (technical competence). This supports C further. So we can maintain vote for C.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 1 and 3, and provide the observations. Then state my vote remains Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
